$ CI delegation create rogue --namespace x --kinds web-app --image-repository k3d-registry.localhost:5000/tan-nb-exp/nagare/x --team t --save-plan ~/.local/state/nagare/drills/mp33-final/reviews/never   # expected refusal
nagarectl delegation create is not available in deployer context ci; a delegated deployer may run app image-plan|check|deploy|delete, worker deploy, task run|delete, site deploy|rollback|preview, inventory apply|resume|status|publications|history, delegation show and version
