$ CI platform status   # expected refusal
nagarectl platform status is not available in deployer context ci; a delegated deployer may run app image-plan|check|deploy|delete, worker deploy, task run|delete, site deploy|rollback|preview, inventory apply|resume|status|publications|history, delegation show and version
exit 1
$ CI app check -f nagare/Config.hs   # expected refusal
nagarectl: nagare: a deployer context never runs a config program (nagare/Config.hs); render it in the build with `nagarectl app|worker|site render` and deploy with --rendered
